-# Semantic Buttons Example Page
- content_for :title, "Semantic Buttons"

%ilw-content.semantic-buttons-page
  %section{ "aria-labelledby" => "semantic-buttons-heading" }
    %h1#semantic-buttons-heading Semantic Buttons
    %p
      Examples below use the current defaults from
      %code ApplicationHelper::IDB_SEMANTIC_BUTTONS
      and render through
      %code semantic_action_button
      with the IDB style.

  %section{ "aria-labelledby" => "semantic-button-options-heading" }
    %h2#semantic-button-options-heading Available button options
    %ul
      - ApplicationHelper::IDB_SEMANTIC_BUTTONS.each do |action, options|
        %li
          %h3= options.fetch(:label)
          = semantic_action_button(action: action, style: :idb)
          %dl
            %dt Action
            %dd= action
            %dt Variant
            %dd= options.fetch(:variant)
            %dt Icon
            %dd
              %code= "#{options.fetch(:icon_style)} fa-#{options.fetch(:icon)}"
